<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-data-poisoning> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "A type of adversarial attack where an adversary or malicious insider injects intentionally corrupted, false, misleading, or incorrect samples into the training or fine-tuning datasets." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-data-poisoning> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "atlas-data-poisoning" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-data-poisoning> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Data poisoning" .
