<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-data-transparency> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Proper documentation contains information about how a model's data was collected, curated, and used to train a model, including any synthetic data generation processes. Without proper documentation it might be harder to satisfactorily explain the behavior of the model." .
