<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-decision-bias> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Decision bias occurs when one group is unfairly advantaged over another due to decisions of the model. This might be caused by biases in the data and also amplified as a result of the model's training." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-decision-bias> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "atlas-decision-bias" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-decision-bias> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Decision bias" .
