<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-direct-instructions-attack> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Prompts, questions, or requests designed to elicit undesirable responses from the application. This approach directly instructs the model to engage in the undesired behavior." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-direct-instructions-attack> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "atlas-direct-instructions-attack" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-direct-instructions-attack> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Direct instructions attack" .
