<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-encoded-interactions-attack> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Prompts that use specific encoding, styles, syntactical and typographical transformations like typographical errors or irregular spacing, or complex formatting to govern the interaction, rendering the model vulnerable." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-encoded-interactions-attack> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "atlas-encoded-interactions-attack" .
