<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-exposing-personal-information> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "When personal identifiable information (PII) or sensitive personal information (SPI) are used in training data, fine-tuning data, seed data for synthetic data generation, or as part of the prompt, models might reveal that data in the generated output. Revealing personal information is a type of data leakage." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-exposing-personal-information> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "atlas-exposing-personal-information" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-exposing-personal-information> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Exposing personal information" .
