<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-external-resources-attack-agentic> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Attackers intentionally create vulnerabilities or exploit existing vulnerabilities in external resources (tools/database/applications/services/other agents) that AI agents rely on to execute their intended actions or to achieve their goals." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-external-resources-attack-agentic> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "atlas-external-resources-attack-agentic" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-external-resources-attack-agentic> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Attack on AI agents' external resources" .
