<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-extraction-attack> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "An extraction attack attempts to copy or steal an AI model by appropriately sampling the input space and observing outputs to build a surrogate model that behaves similarly." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-extraction-attack> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "atlas-extraction-attack" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-extraction-attack> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Extraction attack" .
