<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-function-calling-hallucination-agentic> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "AI agents might make mistakes when generating function calls (calls to tools to execute actions). Those function calls might result in incorrect, unnecessary or harmful actions. Examples: Generating wrong functions or wrong parameters for the functions." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-function-calling-hallucination-agentic> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "atlas-function-calling-hallucination-agentic" .
