<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-lack-domain-expertise> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "A lack of domain expertise occurs when synthetic data generation processes do not involve sufficient consultation with domain experts. This results in a lack of understanding of the specific requirements and nuances of the domain. This can also lead to synthetic data that may not accurately capture the complexities and challenges of a real-world scenario." .
