<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-over-or-under-reliance> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://www.ibm.com/docs/en/watsonx/saas?topic=ai-risk-atlas> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-over-or-under-reliance> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/airkg#Risk> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-over-or-under-reliance> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-over-or-under-reliance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Over- or under-reliance"@en .
