<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-plagiarism> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Easy access to high-quality generative models might result in students that use AI models to plagiarize existing work intentionally or unintentionally." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-plagiarism> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "atlas-plagiarism" .
