<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-poor-model-accuracy> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Poor model accuracy occurs when a model's performance is insufficient to the task it was designed for. Low accuracy might occur if the model is not correctly engineered, or if the model's expected inputs change." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-poor-model-accuracy> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "atlas-poor-model-accuracy" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-poor-model-accuracy> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Poor model accuracy" .
