<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-prompt-injection> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "A prompt injection attack forces a generative model that takes a prompt as input to produce unexpected output by manipulating the structure, instructions or information contained in its prompt. Many types of prompt attacks exist as described in the prompt attack section of the table." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-prompt-injection> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "atlas-prompt-injection" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-prompt-injection> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Prompt injection attack" .
