<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-prompt-leaking> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "'A prompt leak attack attempts to extract a model's system prompt (also known as the system message).'" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-prompt-leaking> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "atlas-prompt-leaking" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-prompt-leaking> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Prompt leaking" .
