<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-prompt-priming> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Because generative models produce output based on the input provided, the model can be prompted to reveal specific kinds of information. For example, adding personal information in the prompt increases its likelihood of generating similar kinds of personal information in its output. If personal data was included as part of the model's training, there is a possibility it could be revealed." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-prompt-priming> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "atlas-prompt-priming" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-prompt-priming> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Prompt priming" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-prompt-priming> <http://example.org/airkg#source> "https://www.ibm.com/docs/en/watsonx/saas?topic=SSYOK8/wsj/ai-risk-atlas/prompt-priming.html"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-prompt-priming> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-prompt-priming> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://www.ibm.com/docs/en/watsonx/saas?topic=ai-risk-atlas> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-prompt-priming> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/airkg#Risk> .
