<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-reidentification> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Even with the removal of personal information (PI) and sensitive personal information (SPI) from data, it might be possible to identify persons due to correlations to other features available in the data." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-reidentification> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "atlas-reidentification" .
