<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-sharing-info-user-agentic> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "AI agents with unrestricted access to resources or databases or tools could potentially store and share PI/IP/confidential information with system users when performing their actions." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-sharing-info-user-agentic> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "atlas-sharing-info-user-agentic" .
