<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-spreading-disinformation> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Generative AI models might be used to intentionally create misleading or false information to deceive or influence a targeted audience." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-spreading-disinformation> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "atlas-spreading-disinformation" .
