<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-spreading-toxicity> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Generative AI models might be used intentionally to generate hateful, abusive, and profane (HAP) or obscene content." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-spreading-toxicity> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "atlas-spreading-toxicity" .
