<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-toxic-output> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Toxic output occurs when the model produces hateful, abusive, and profane (HAP) or obscene content. This also includes behaviors like bullying." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-toxic-output> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "atlas-toxic-output" .
